      "problem": "The row echelon form matrix $B$ is given below. What are the pivot columns of $B?$\n\n$$\nB=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$",
